,"occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T20:31:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042922","verified_at":"2026-10-25T22:36:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5076320-1847286114029245","game_id":"steam-5076320","kind":"update","title":"A small demo update, thanks to your feedback","summary":"A small update for the Carpet Daddy demo, based on your feedback: A clearer crosshair to help with aiming. Fixes for issues when loading jobs. Controller improvements for smoother movement and easier interactions. A higher completion threshold: carpets now need to be 99.8% clean and almost dry before the completion ding, so it should feel better earned. Thanks to everyone who’s tried the demo and shared feedback. There’s still work to do, but your reports are helping us make it a little better w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:28:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029245","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:33:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5076320-1846651706689433","game_id":"steam-5076320","kind":"update","title":"Small demo update — 18 October","summary":"https://clan.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/46269677/d16940e4f58063385e4b819ed1615ba93788e4db.png Pushed a small update to the demo to make it easier for me to analyse errors, especially when a job fails to load. I've also added a bit more detail to the existing optional analytics so I can understand where people get stuck in training. This information is only sent if you've opted in. Thanks for giving the demo a go and for letting me know when something isn't working.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:22:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689433","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5076320-1846651706684072","game_id":"steam-5076320","kind":"announcement","title":"The Carpet Daddy Demo Is Out Now! Play for Free!","summary":"Hey everyone, The free Carpet Daddy demo is out now on Steam! Grab your tools and turn filthy carpets into satisfying clean stripes. Vacuum, pre-spray, agitate and extract, tackle stubborn stains, and move furniture to reach the dirt underneath. Download the free demo and get cleaning! https://clan.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/46269677/7a59fc4d24a6f08f372f5df2e6102bbe8e80f665.png What's in the demo? A tutorial to learn the cleaning tools and process. Your first full cleaning mission to put thos","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T08:23:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684072","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5076320-1846018067937376","game_id":"steam-5076320","kind":"announcement","title":"Carpet Daddy's free demo is planned for 17 October","summary":"Carpet Daddy's free demo is planned for 17 October 2026. Vacuum, treat stains and extract dirt to turn filthy carpets into satisfying clean stripes. https://clan.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/46269677/7a59fc4d24a6f08f372f5df2e6102bbe8e80f665.png What's in the demo? A tutorial to learn the cleaning process. Your first full cleaning mission. A fun challenge mission. A limited selection of tools and upgrades. Visit the demo page and wishlist Carpet Daddy to follow development.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T21:52:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/18460180679373